{"4730960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Radio Tower", "steam_appid": 4730960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/48380b8815c7c20c9164158f550be91e.avif?t=1783430777\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A linear Horror story were you<strong> climb</strong> a <strong>radio tower </strong>at the edge of an evacuation zone and <strong>fix it</strong> by performing various tasks to restore the communications for a nearby city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But your confidence wavers as you realize something is stalking you from deep within the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/5f92e919df92cbf15b4c08fd60f94f77.poster.avif?t=1783430777\" width=854 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/5f92e919df92cbf15b4c08fd60f94f77.webm?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/5f92e919df92cbf15b4c08fd60f94f77.mp4?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/45b8846edc54c9c98a700597982594a9.avif?t=1783430777\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your name is John and your job is to <strong>climb the tallest towers in the world</strong> to maintain them, this time you were called urgently to <strong>fix the only tower </strong>providing cover to the small <strong>Crimsonpine</strong> city that is currently <strong>on quarantine</strong> for unknown reasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/70ac2386c779c2046f200eb62e4a4b68.poster.avif?t=1783430777\" width=854 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/70ac2386c779c2046f200eb62e4a4b68.webm?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/70ac2386c779c2046f200eb62e4a4b68.mp4?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/02dd64424f98fe2312e1c615a0b021e4.avif?t=1783430777\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A <strong>short but immersive horror</strong> experience set in a remote radio tower inside a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/431e7cb2c5f4c7c0bc472b533863597c.poster.avif?t=1783430777\" width=854 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/431e7cb2c5f4c7c0bc472b533863597c.webm?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/431e7cb2c5f4c7c0bc472b533863597c.mp4?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the Climber:</strong> Immersive first person tower climbing mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linear progression:</strong> A carefully crafted journey through multiple challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings: </strong>Your chorices will have consequences way bigger than yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive environments: </strong>Dense forest environment and sounds that put you in John's shoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase secuencies &amp; survival mechanics:</strong> The threat grows more present the further you advance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery:</strong> Piece together the truth to take the right decisions.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/48380b8815c7c20c9164158f550be91e.avif?t=1783430777\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A linear Horror story were you<strong> climb</strong> a <strong>radio tower </strong>at the edge of an evacuation zone and <strong>fix it</strong> by performing various tasks to restore the communications for a nearby city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But your confidence wavers as you realize something is stalking you from deep within the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/5f92e919df92cbf15b4c08fd60f94f77.poster.avif?t=1783430777\" width=854 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/5f92e919df92cbf15b4c08fd60f94f77.webm?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/5f92e919df92cbf15b4c08fd60f94f77.mp4?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/45b8846edc54c9c98a700597982594a9.avif?t=1783430777\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your name is John and your job is to <strong>climb the tallest towers in the world</strong> to maintain them, this time you were called urgently to <strong>fix the only tower </strong>providing cover to the small <strong>Crimsonpine</strong> city that is currently <strong>on quarantine</strong> for unknown reasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/70ac2386c779c2046f200eb62e4a4b68.poster.avif?t=1783430777\" width=854 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/70ac2386c779c2046f200eb62e4a4b68.webm?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/70ac2386c779c2046f200eb62e4a4b68.mp4?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/02dd64424f98fe2312e1c615a0b021e4.avif?t=1783430777\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A <strong>short but immersive horror</strong> experience set in a remote radio tower inside a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/431e7cb2c5f4c7c0bc472b533863597c.poster.avif?t=1783430777\" width=854 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/431e7cb2c5f4c7c0bc472b533863597c.webm?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730960/extras/431e7cb2c5f4c7c0bc472b533863597c.mp4?t=1783430777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the Climber:</strong> Immersive first person tower climbing mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linear progression:</strong> A carefully crafted journey through multiple challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings: </strong>Your chorices will have consequences way bigger than yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive environments: </strong>Dense forest environment and sounds that put you in John's shoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase secuencies &amp; survival mechanics:</strong> The threat grows more present the further you advance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery:</strong> Piece together the truth to take the right decisions.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Your job is to climb the tallest towers in the world to maintain them, this time you were called urgently to fix the only tower providing cover to the small Crimsonpine city that is currently on quarantine.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>langu